WEBVTT

00:08:59.871 --> 00:09:04.537
and the genetic parents
had no legal rights at all

00:09:04.537 --> 00:09:06.787
to their own genetic children.

00:09:08.287 --> 00:09:10.746
It's time for the law to change.

00:09:11.204 --> 00:09:13.329
Here in Colorado,

00:09:13.371 --> 00:09:18.079
our lone egg and sperm donation
statute has the language

00:09:18.121 --> 00:09:21.037
"a wife with her husband's consent."

00:09:22.079 --> 00:09:23.246
(Laughter)

00:09:23.287 --> 00:09:27.621
It's a little offensive
to us liberated women,

00:09:27.662 --> 00:09:30.996
but also doesn't include
single parents by choice